@page
@model KopiCinta.Pages.TeamAxelModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Axel Marcellino Antonio";
}

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">

        <div class="back-top reveal">
            <a asp-page="/Team">← Back</a>
        </div>

        <div class="event-hero reveal">
            <div class="event-hero-text">
                <p class="eyebrow">Our Team</p>
                <h2>Axel Marcellino Antonio</h2>

                <p class="event-intro">
                    The prankster of the group—bringing joy, service,
                    and a strong willingness to keep growing through every task he does.
                </p>

                <div class="event-tags">
                    <span>Deaf Staff</span>
                    <span>Service</span>
                    <span>Joyful Energy</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="team-profile-hero-img reveal">
                <img src="/images/team/axel.jpg" alt="Axel Marcellino Antonio">
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hbii-block reveal">
            <div class="hbii-block-text">
                <p class="hbii-label">His Beginning</p>
                <h3>Growing Since 2023</h3>

                <p>
                    Axel began his journey with Kopi Cinta in December 2023.
                    Since then, he has continued growing as part of the team,
                    taking on roles in the bar, popcorn, and cotton candy stations.
                </p>

                <p>
                    In his daily work, he prepares drinks, serves customers,
                    and creates small joyful moments for families who visit.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-block-card">
                <h4>His Role</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>Bar service</li>
                    <li>Popcorn station</li>
                    <li>Cotton candy station</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hbii-feature reveal">
            <div class="hbii-feature-card">
                <p class="hbii-label">Meaning</p>
                <h3>More Than Just a Workplace</h3>

                <p>
                    For Axel, Kopi Cinta is more than just a place to work.
                    It is an inclusive environment where he can learn,
                    grow, and become more independent.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Over time, he found pride in what he does
                    and comfort in being part of a supportive team.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-feature-card soft">
                <p class="hbii-label">Challenge</p>
                <h3>Different Ways of Communicating</h3>

                <p>
                    One of Axel’s main challenges is communicating with customers
                    who are not familiar with sign language,
                    or when lip-reading becomes difficult.
                </p>

                <p>
                    But there is always a way—
                    through writing, simple gestures, or support from teammates.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hbii-ending reveal">
            <h3>His Hope</h3>
            <p>
                Axel hopes hearing people can be more patient and open
                when communicating with Deaf staff.
            </p>
            <p>
                For him, communication is not about using the same way—
                but about the willingness to understand.
            </p>
        </div>
        <br />
        <div class="detail-back reveal">
            <a asp-page="/Team" class="btn btn-secondary">← Back to Team</a>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>